Package: normalize
Type: Package
Title: Centering and Scaling of Numeric Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Lennart", "Oelschl\u00e4ger", email = "oelschlaeger.lennart@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Centers and scales numeric data in vectors, matrices, data
    frames, time series, and lists of these objects. Rows or columns can be
    left unchanged or be normalized jointly. The values used for centering and
    scaling are returned as attributes.
